			<div class="content" id="post-content-780254">
									

<p>My latest creation. Let me know if I'm correct in suspecting that it gets too technical and that it needs trimming. I went into possibly too much detail about its life cycle, partially because I worked out a complete (and very plausible) life cycle with the help of a friend that knows more than I ever wanted to know about roundworm biology.</p>
